gh a challenging few  few years and all of that now is  actually pushing us out of the  profession the nhs is much more than  just buildings and beds it's the it's  the people in the building  the nhs workforce crisis is growing as  it does  long-suffering patients will have to  wait longer  and suffer more  joshi sky news west london
 

